  <h2>Build the unreal past and mixed-time consequence</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="if the team had tested older phones it might have found the problem" data-hint="Begin with If the team had tested older phones, then add the calibrated past possibility." data-fix="If the team had tested older phones, it might have found the problem." data-success-message="Correct. The Past Perfect marks the unreal test, and might have found preserves uncertainty about the past result.">
    <h3>Builder 1: past alternative and past possibility</h3><p class="tile-target">Build the complete Third Conditional.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank><button class="tile" data-build-tile="problem">problem</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="team">team</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="might">might</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="phones">phones</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="If">If</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="found">found</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="tested">tested</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="it">it</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="the">the</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="had">had</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="have">have</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="older">older</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="the">the</button></div>
    <div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap words in order"></div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>
  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="if the plan had included an offline form staff would have less work now" data-hint="Begin with If the plan had included an offline form, then connect it to the present workload." data-fix="If the plan had included an offline form, staff would have less work now." data-success-message="Correct. The missing past safeguard is linked to an unreal present workload without changing the time of either part.">
